      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass in the fourth year of king Darius, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the word of the LORD came to Zechariah in the fourth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "day",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the ninth month, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in Chisleu;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When they had sent to the house of God Sherezer and Regem-melech, and their men, to pray before the LORD,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to speak to the priests who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the house of the LORD of hosts, and to the prophets, saying, Should I weep in the fifth month, separating myself, as I have done these so many years?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then came the word of the LORD of hosts to me, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Speak to all the people of the land, and to the priests, saying, When ye fasted and mourned in the fifth and seventh ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "month",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", even those seventy years, did ye at all fast to me, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to me?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when ye ate, and when ye drank, did ye not eat ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for yourselves",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and drink ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for yourselves",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Should ye",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "hear",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the words which the LORD hath cried by the former prophets, when Jerusalem was inhabited and in prosperity, and her cities around her, when ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " inhabited the south and the plain?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the word of the LORD came to Zechariah, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus speaketh the LORD of hosts, saying, Execute true judgment, and show mercy and compassions every man to his brother:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And oppress not the widow, nor the fatherless, the stranger, nor the poor; and let none of you imagine evil against his brother in your heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But they refused to hearken, and withdrew the shoulder, and stopped their ears, that they should not hear.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yes, they made their hearts ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an adamant stone, lest they should hear the law, and the words which the LORD of hosts hath sent in his spirit by the former prophets: therefore came a great wrath from the LORD of hosts.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore it is come to pass, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as he cried, and they would not hear; so they cried, and I would not hear, saith the LORD of hosts:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ZEC.7.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ZEC.7.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I scattered them with a whirlwind among all the nations whom they knew not. Thus the land was desolate after them, that no man passed through nor returned: for they laid the pleasant land desolate.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
